   1900  7081							;----------------------------------------
   1901  7081							; Display Data
   1902  7081							;----------------------------------------
   1903  7081							; The Display Data bank is copied into RAM when DPC+ initializes the cartridge.
   1904  7081							; This allows us to manipulate the data during run-time, but have a known
   1905  7081							; starting state when the Atari is first turned on.
   1906  7081							;
   1907  7081							; Unlike normal Atari VCS/2600 sprite definitions, the sprite data in the
   1908  7081							; Display Data bank is stored right-side-up.
   1909  7081							;
   1910  7081							;----------------------------------------
